    <string name="text_02001">Mocii Home helps you create your shopping list, register it as a purchase, and automatically get the balance of your accounts.</string>
    <string name="text_02002">FEATURES:</string>
    <string name="text_02003">- Plan your daily meals for the week.</string>
    <string name="text_02004">- Register your purchases in detail, so you dont forget anything while shopping.</string>
    <string name="text_02005">- Generate a copy of your purchases, as we know they often repeat.</string>
    <string name="text_02006">- Register transactions such as payments or transfers.</string>
    <string name="text_02007">- Get your FINANCIAL BALANCE automatically.</string>
    <string name="text_02008">- Generate statistical charts with your most expensive products.</string>
    <string name="text_02009">- Search for previously registered products.</string>
    <string name="text_02010">FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS:</string>
    <string name="text_02011">Where can I get help in the APP?</string>
    <string name="text_02012">To read this help, press the three dots in the upper-right corner and select Help on the main screen.</string>
    <string name="text_02013">Where can I get more information about the APP?</string>
    <string name="text_02014">For more details on the functionality, visit @MociiHome on YouTube.</string>
    <string name="text_02015">How do I register a purchase?</string>
    <string name="text_02016">First, register a purchase, then tap on it to add products.</string>
    <string name="text_02017">How do I edit or delete an item?</string>
    <string name="text_02018">To edit or delete an item (purchase, transaction, etc.), press and hold the item.</string>
    <string name="text_02019">How do I register my shopping list as a purchase?</string>
    <string name="text_02020">After creating your shopping list, you can register it as a purchase and affect your accounts. Press and hold the registered product.</string>
    <string name="text_02021">Why are there two numbers displayed in INCOME and EXPENSES?</string>
    <string name="text_02022">On the home screen, the larger number represents confirmed purchases and transactions for the month, while the smaller number shows unconfirmed purchases and transactions.</string>
